    "details": "https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/security/advisories/GHSA-5rjg-fvgr-3xxf\nreports:\n\n> setuptools is a package that allows users to download, build, install,\n> upgrade, and uninstall Python packages. A path traversal vulnerability\n> in \\`PackageIndex\\` is present in setuptools prior to version 78.1.1.\n> An attacker would be allowed to write files to arbitrary locations on\n> the filesystem with the permissions of the process running the Python\n> code, which could escalate to remote code execution depending on the\n> context.\n",
